WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:40.840 --> 01:41.380
Who is it?

01:44.870 --> 01:45.290
Father.

01:45.590 --> 01:46.290
It is me.

01:49.640 --> 01:51.130
You grow ever less mannered.

01:51.710 --> 01:52.900
Why not wait to be announced?

01:53.120 --> 01:53.900
Father.

01:56.150 --> 01:57.620
I have words for you.

01:57.870 --> 01:59.180
You have grown up,

01:59.350 --> 02:01.260
and you've grown bolder as well.

02:03.480 --> 02:05.820
As a child, I saw you give
the Dragon Gate Token to Jia.

02:06.430 --> 02:08.850
All the Dragon Palace praised him.

02:09.520 --> 02:11.290
And I could only use a fake token

02:12.120 --> 02:14.100
to play childish games with the maids.

02:16.430 --> 02:17.690
I must have disappointed you.

02:28.590 --> 02:29.690
Did you come here

02:30.870 --> 02:32.890
to say this to me?

02:33.430 --> 02:34.220
Yes.

02:35.280 --> 02:36.060
No.

02:36.310 --> 02:36.850
Father,

02:37.470 --> 02:38.290
I want...

02:38.310 --> 02:39.690
I want to ask you for an order

02:39.840 --> 02:40.660
to stop Jia.

02:40.680 --> 02:41.410
How insolent.

02:41.430 --> 02:42.450
Brat.

02:42.560 --> 02:44.380
What do you know of war and statecraft?

02:44.470 --> 02:45.850
And you dare lecture me?

02:45.870 --> 02:46.940
But do you know Jia is now

02:46.960 --> 02:48.380
hunting down Qi refiners?

02:51.520 --> 02:52.410
Or...

02:53.000 --> 02:53.820
Do you pretend

02:54.870 --> 02:56.500
not to know?

02:57.080 --> 02:58.890
Jia has his own judgment.

02:58.910 --> 02:59.890
He won't.

03:00.630 --> 03:02.060
He's still stuck in the past,

03:02.080 --> 03:03.820
when the Dragon Clan ruled the world.

03:03.840 --> 03:06.220
But human powerhouses emerge endlessly,

03:06.310 --> 03:08.340
while we dragons make no changes,

03:08.360 --> 03:09.820
still living in the past.

03:10.710 --> 03:11.570
It's time

03:12.120 --> 03:13.290
for us to wake up.

03:34.840 --> 03:35.780
Yi.

03:36.360 --> 03:37.290
Good.

03:37.680 --> 03:39.850
It looks like you've truly grown up.

03:41.120 --> 03:42.890
But since every word you say is right,

03:43.430 --> 03:46.290
why don't you tell your brother?

03:53.750 --> 03:54.610
I will.

04:02.540 --> 04:05.500
[Episode 10]

04:11.840 --> 04:14.660
Finally, you're out alone.

04:15.080 --> 04:16.020
Who are you?

04:16.040 --> 04:18.170
You don't need to know.

04:18.510 --> 04:20.020
You only need to know

04:20.070 --> 04:22.980
that I'm here to kill you.

04:23.680 --> 04:25.100
To flee the Dragon Palace,

04:25.270 --> 04:26.900
you must open the Water Dragon Spout.

04:26.920 --> 04:28.140
In the Dragon Palace,

04:28.160 --> 04:29.700
those who can open the Spout

04:30.120 --> 04:31.900
are only the Dragon King
and his two sons.

04:32.120 --> 04:33.580
The First Prince won't open it.

04:33.750 --> 04:35.290
The Dragon King won't intervene.

04:35.510 --> 04:36.340
So,

04:36.600 --> 04:38.490
Ascendance Sect's only hope of rescue

04:39.720 --> 04:41.170
is Ao Yi.

04:42.870 --> 04:45.250
You want me to kill Ao Yi?

04:47.560 --> 04:49.410
For the First Prince to rule East Sea,

04:50.480 --> 04:53.850
the Second Prince has to go eventually.

04:55.120 --> 04:56.610
Why not use this chance

04:57.120 --> 04:58.580
to frame the Human Clan?

05:00.270 --> 05:01.250
Okay.

05:01.270 --> 05:03.050
Remember what you promised:

05:03.360 --> 05:04.980
Once I've done this for you,

05:05.510 --> 05:07.490
you'll let me return to Ascendance Sect.

05:11.510 --> 05:13.020
Not only that.

05:14.120 --> 05:16.020
I'll help you spread the rumors

05:16.430 --> 05:18.340
that the dragons' invitation

05:18.360 --> 05:20.020
is a conspiracy.

05:21.720 --> 05:23.810
Ascendance Sect disciples
were decimated.

05:25.270 --> 05:28.610
Only you fought free.

05:29.040 --> 05:30.050
At that time,

05:31.630 --> 05:34.100
you'll be a hero to the Human Clan.

05:34.920 --> 05:35.700
Perfect.

05:36.240 --> 05:38.220
I can also conveniently eliminate

05:38.310 --> 05:41.250
those defiant sect disciples.

05:42.630 --> 05:43.930
After you die,

05:44.190 --> 05:46.020
the First Prince can be at ease

05:46.040 --> 05:48.020
as the Crown Prince.

05:48.040 --> 05:48.810
Nonsense.

05:49.270 --> 05:50.900
My brother and I share a deep bond.

05:50.920 --> 05:52.290
How could he send someone to kill me?

05:58.040 --> 06:00.900
I've heard
of the Dragon Transformation Art.

06:00.920 --> 06:02.490
Since you are a dragon prince,

06:02.750 --> 06:05.020
why not fight in dragon form?

06:08.160 --> 06:10.050
You asked for this.

06:21.120 --> 06:23.100
Transform into a dragon.

06:30.430 --> 06:31.900
Just as the rumors said.

06:32.040 --> 06:33.660
Though you bear the Dragon's Prophecy,

06:33.680 --> 06:35.410
you cannot transform at all.

06:35.510 --> 06:37.700
A dragon heir who cannot transform

06:37.950 --> 06:40.660
is not worth living.

06:44.630 --> 06:45.900
Here I come!

06:52.430 --> 06:53.220
Shoot!

06:57.270 --> 06:58.810
I see.

07:05.190 --> 07:05.700
Sir,

07:06.310 --> 07:07.100
it's you.

07:07.270 --> 07:08.100
Who are you?

07:08.120 --> 07:09.100
State your name!

07:10.510 --> 07:12.610
I never bother with formalities.

07:12.720 --> 07:14.490
If I told you just because you asked...

07:14.830 --> 07:16.020
Sure, we can tell you.

07:16.160 --> 07:17.580
This is Changgeng.

07:19.120 --> 07:20.290
You're Changgeng?

07:20.310 --> 07:21.370
I am Changgeng?

07:22.270 --> 07:23.490
There's no need to hide it.

07:23.510 --> 07:24.100
The day we parted,

07:24.120 --> 07:25.020
you pointed your finger skyward,

07:25.040 --> 07:25.780
facing the distant west.

07:25.800 --> 07:27.490
As they say, Qiming in the east;
Changgeng in the west.

07:27.510 --> 07:29.490
That is your name, Changgeng.

07:32.830 --> 07:34.460
You're indeed clever.

07:35.630 --> 07:37.410
This humble one is called Changgeng.

07:37.560 --> 07:39.250
I never change my name.

07:39.270 --> 07:40.290
What? Are you not convinced?

07:40.310 --> 07:41.290
Well said.

07:42.630 --> 07:44.250
Young man, do you remember my words?

07:44.510 --> 07:45.290
Of course.

07:45.310 --> 07:47.370
I'll go find my brother
to open the Water Dragon Spout.

07:47.920 --> 07:48.850
That won't be necessary.

07:53.950 --> 07:54.780
[Token]
The Dragon Gate Token?

07:58.510 --> 07:59.660
What are you laughing at?

08:01.430 --> 08:02.250
You go ahead.

08:02.510 --> 08:04.780
I'll stay here and play with him.

08:04.920 --> 08:05.700
Okay.

08:17.510 --> 08:18.900
I'm an Aureate Immortal.

08:18.920 --> 08:20.460
You're no match for me.

08:47.320 --> 08:48.300
What demon are you?

08:55.960 --> 08:57.100
Where's your martial honor?

08:57.320 --> 08:59.460
Face me head-on if you dare.

08:59.510 --> 09:01.850
Stop these lowly tricks.

09:10.750 --> 09:12.010
They're surprisingly powerful.

09:12.030 --> 09:12.700
No, no.

09:12.720 --> 09:13.980
I need a rest.

09:14.030 --> 09:16.370
Open the Dragon Gate now,

09:16.510 --> 09:18.490
and let us out!

09:18.720 --> 09:19.770
Dream on.

09:20.080 --> 09:21.530
The Dragon Gate Token
is with His Highness.

09:21.550 --> 09:22.530
No one's opening it.

09:22.550 --> 09:23.850
I'll kill you!

09:23.870 --> 09:24.890
[Token]
The Dragon Gate Token is here.

09:26.630 --> 09:27.820
Your Highness.

09:28.080 --> 09:28.610
Everyone,

09:28.630 --> 09:30.060
I'll use the Token to open
the Water Dragon Spout.

09:30.080 --> 09:30.650
Leave now.

09:41.670 --> 09:42.460
Jia.

09:45.120 --> 09:46.700
Do you know what you're doing?

09:47.790 --> 09:48.010
I...

09:48.030 --> 09:48.820
Get back there!

09:53.360 --> 09:54.340
Trying to run?

10:00.390 --> 10:01.820
The one who killed Yecha

10:02.240 --> 10:04.420
has been executed at the Eye of the Sea.

10:06.750 --> 10:07.700
Senior Changshou.

10:07.960 --> 10:09.300
You may not be the killers,

10:09.480 --> 10:10.890
but you are all his accomplices.

10:11.510 --> 10:12.250
Spare none.

10:12.270 --> 10:12.890
Yes.

10:14.120 --> 10:16.100
I will avenge Senior Changshou.

10:25.320 --> 10:26.700
I'm an Aureate Immortal.

10:26.720 --> 10:28.610
How could I lose
to a sneaking coward like you?

10:28.630 --> 10:29.890
Come out! Let's fight again.

10:31.270 --> 10:32.180
Kuai Si?

10:34.030 --> 10:36.490
You dare call me a sneaking coward?

10:37.240 --> 10:38.100
I wasn't talking about you.

10:38.360 --> 10:39.300
Kill this one first.

10:39.320 --> 10:40.100
Don't attack!

10:40.750 --> 10:41.650
I am not your enemy.

10:42.480 --> 10:43.610
I'm not your match.

10:43.630 --> 10:44.650
Elder Kuai Si.

10:45.240 --> 10:46.650
You said you came for your disciples,

10:46.670 --> 10:48.300
so I sent you on your way.

10:48.320 --> 10:49.370
You're welcome.

10:49.510 --> 10:52.060
Do I need to tell everyone

10:52.510 --> 10:53.820
what happened?

10:57.360 --> 10:58.890
I was held up

10:58.910 --> 11:00.010
by Dragon Palace troops.

11:00.630 --> 11:02.890
Thanks to this cultivator's help,

11:03.120 --> 11:05.100
I could come and join you all.

11:06.120 --> 11:08.850
Thank you, Changgeng.

11:09.030 --> 11:10.100
Don't mention it.

11:11.390 --> 11:12.460
Changgeng?

11:13.320 --> 11:14.700
I've never heard of him.

11:14.720 --> 11:16.580
Just another human scoundrel.

11:16.960 --> 11:18.490
The Human Clan has no good folk.

11:18.750 --> 11:19.530
Kill them.

11:24.030 --> 11:25.460
The Fairy is so thoughtful.

11:34.870 --> 11:36.010
Yunxiao, you needed me?

11:37.320 --> 11:38.340
With your cultivation, rascal,

11:38.360 --> 11:39.850
I'm afraid you can't comprehend

11:39.870 --> 11:41.300
the wonder of Resonance.

11:43.150 --> 11:44.940
You saw through me that easily?

11:44.960 --> 11:46.250
You needn't speak to me.

11:46.270 --> 11:47.460
As you can see,

11:47.510 --> 11:50.180
this is a projection formed
by a trace of my Resonance.

11:50.910 --> 11:52.180
So, it's a recording.

11:52.200 --> 11:52.940
You coaxed me away;

11:52.960 --> 11:53.850
the one who lured me here

11:53.870 --> 11:55.060
will surely not let you off.

11:55.480 --> 11:57.730
So, I left a tenth of my power
in the Resonance

11:57.790 --> 11:58.650
to help you survive this calamity.

11:59.670 --> 12:01.890
After all,
this matter began because of me.

12:01.960 --> 12:03.530
I suppose you'll ask me

12:03.840 --> 12:04.980
why I would help you.

12:05.510 --> 12:07.420
Because you're a useful pawn.

12:07.670 --> 12:09.580
I may need you later.

12:09.670 --> 12:10.890
So, you don't have to die just yet.

12:10.910 --> 12:13.100
You're quite honest.

12:13.120 --> 12:14.530
But if you don't believe me...

12:14.840 --> 12:16.490
Of course, I believe you.

12:16.510 --> 12:17.580
For all these years,

12:17.670 --> 12:19.100
I've hidden behind a cold facade,

12:19.320 --> 12:21.650
pretending to be
heartless and unfeeling.

12:21.960 --> 12:24.250
But I never expected you
to see right through me.

12:24.750 --> 12:25.460
Well.

12:26.030 --> 12:27.300
Not entirely...

12:27.320 --> 12:27.820
Remember:

12:28.080 --> 12:29.890
The Resonance power will run out.

12:30.510 --> 12:31.490
Cherish it.

12:41.330 --> 12:43.840
♪Once a drifting weed, I loved to roam♪

12:44.270 --> 12:46.520
♪Now, a levee holds back the storm♪

12:47.120 --> 12:47.850
Primordial Vessel.

12:48.200 --> 12:48.980
Open!

12:51.240 --> 12:51.820
I...

12:52.030 --> 12:52.580
I...

12:54.150 --> 12:54.940
I...

12:56.030 --> 12:57.060
My hammer!

12:59.600 --> 13:00.890
Yunxiao is truly thoughtful.

13:02.600 --> 13:03.700
Primordial Vessel?

13:04.480 --> 13:05.700
He can do this too.

13:10.720 --> 13:11.490
Move!

13:14.930 --> 13:15.860
♪Plain and unremarkable♪

13:15.860 --> 13:16.940
♪From the start, plan for storms♪

13:16.940 --> 13:18.090
♪Seek refuge, survive, hide my skill♪

13:18.090 --> 13:19.310
♪If smooth, seek peace♪

13:19.310 --> 13:20.680
♪If tough, stay still;
who fates good and evil♪

13:20.680 --> 13:21.910
♪After hardship, sweetness comes;
fear nothing♪

13:22.120 --> 13:23.250
Your Highness, be careful!

13:23.250 --> 13:24.910
♪Mad ones, why ruin your foundation♪

13:24.910 --> 13:26.110
♪The evil knows no shame♪

13:26.110 --> 13:27.500
♪Immortal trials burn cowardice away♪

13:27.500 --> 13:28.710
♪The howling wind calls to me♪

13:28.710 --> 13:29.990
♪Gouging eyes to light the night
and ferry souls♪

13:29.990 --> 13:31.390
♪My soul is standing like a mountain♪

13:31.480 --> 13:32.300
Stay away from him!

13:32.630 --> 13:34.370
Your brother has gone mad now.

13:34.510 --> 13:37.060
All hope of the Human Clan rests on you.

13:37.670 --> 13:38.650
What should I do?

13:38.720 --> 13:39.490
The Dragon Gate Token.

13:39.550 --> 13:39.890
But

13:40.910 --> 13:42.220
the Token is already...

13:46.840 --> 13:47.610
It's all right.

13:47.840 --> 13:50.180
The Dragon King's son
can command the Water Dragon Spout.

13:50.720 --> 13:51.490
I...

13:52.790 --> 13:53.580
Can I?

13:53.960 --> 13:55.250
You can.

13:58.440 --> 13:59.300
Look at me.

14:01.120 --> 14:02.220
The future you.

14:02.510 --> 14:03.010
Ao Yi.

14:03.960 --> 14:04.700
Remember?

14:05.750 --> 14:08.010
Don't you want to become
who you truly wish to be

14:08.150 --> 14:09.650
and transform into a dragon?

14:10.320 --> 14:12.580
Trust me. You can do it.

14:13.240 --> 14:14.010
Can I?

14:15.120 --> 14:15.890
Yes.

14:19.120 --> 14:20.100
Are you two close?

14:20.120 --> 14:21.490
Why all this pointless chatter?

14:21.720 --> 14:22.490
Shut up.

14:29.240 --> 14:30.700
Sect disciples, prepare to retreat.

14:31.030 --> 14:32.130
Who are you?

14:32.150 --> 14:33.370
Why are you leading my brother astray?

14:33.510 --> 14:35.300
He has grown up now.

14:35.320 --> 14:37.060
He has the right to choose his own path.

14:37.270 --> 14:38.610
If you have the guts, come at me.

14:38.630 --> 14:40.580
Why pick on a minor dragon?

14:40.670 --> 14:41.770
He's still far from growing up.

14:41.790 --> 14:43.100
Far from growing up.

14:44.030 --> 14:45.220
The outcome is decided.

14:45.360 --> 14:46.700
The First Prince wins.

14:47.120 --> 14:47.650
Yi,

14:48.870 --> 14:50.010
you still haven't grown up.

14:51.910 --> 14:54.730
It seems you're still a little dragon.

14:54.750 --> 14:56.060
The Second Prince is still young.

14:56.320 --> 14:58.490
He's no match for the First Prince.

15:03.200 --> 15:03.980
Ao Yi.

15:04.000 --> 15:04.770
Pah!

15:04.870 --> 15:06.890
Stop with that nonsense.

15:06.960 --> 15:08.220
You don't get to decide.

15:08.240 --> 15:09.490
In my eyes,

15:09.630 --> 15:11.610
the Second Prince is resolute.

15:11.630 --> 15:13.060
He's a dragon with great aspirations,

15:13.080 --> 15:15.010
far better than a big dragon like you.

15:15.030 --> 15:16.420
Don't use your authority as his brother

15:16.440 --> 15:17.340
to stunt his growth.

15:17.360 --> 15:18.130
That's rubbish...

15:18.510 --> 15:19.100
Isn't that so?

15:19.720 --> 15:20.850
Silence implies agreement.

15:26.270 --> 15:27.250
See? Your brother agrees.

15:56.670 --> 15:58.580
What a spectacular Water Dragon Spout!

15:58.750 --> 16:01.060
Grander than the Spout

16:01.080 --> 16:02.060
I created back then!

16:02.720 --> 16:03.700
Your Majesty, you're wise.

16:03.720 --> 16:04.890
You're wise indeed!

16:10.870 --> 16:12.460
Sect members, evacuate!

16:12.480 --> 16:13.010
Run!

16:13.030 --> 16:13.580
Okay.

16:13.750 --> 16:14.180
Let's go!

16:14.630 --> 16:15.060
Let's go.

16:16.240 --> 16:17.100
Changgeng,

16:18.150 --> 16:19.060
you're a human, right?

16:19.440 --> 16:20.370
You've got a sharp eye.

16:20.840 --> 16:22.180
Will we see each other again?

16:22.670 --> 16:24.010
If you never forget your true heart,

16:24.360 --> 16:25.460
we will meet again.

16:26.670 --> 16:27.220
Goodbye.

16:28.030 --> 16:28.580
Goodbye.

16:30.240 --> 16:30.770
Goodbye.

16:32.160 --> 16:32.870
Wretched beast!

16:44.790 --> 16:46.770
♪I don't ask, too lazy to fight♪

16:47.040 --> 16:49.000
♪I dare to live my own way♪

16:49.000 --> 16:51.310
♪In the Primordial World♪

16:51.310 --> 16:53.300
♪Who sings and drinks free♪

16:53.300 --> 16:55.660
♪The stars smile at fireflies♪

16:55.660 --> 16:57.860
♪Roaming the city with reckless courage♪

16:57.860 --> 17:00.080
♪Just watching swordplay while drunk♪

17:00.080 --> 17:01.700
♪And in dreams, I reign supreme♪

17:02.000 --> 17:03.870
♪Who can ever♪

17:03.870 --> 17:06.050
♪Predict the clock of time♪

17:06.050 --> 17:08.810
♪Learn the watches of the night♪

17:10.070 --> 17:11.490
What have you done?

17:12.350 --> 17:13.570
My Dragon Gate Token!

17:14.960 --> 17:17.660
Jia, you've caused a great calamity!

17:18.000 --> 17:20.620
Henceforth,
all your authority is revoked;

17:20.680 --> 17:23.570
your title as the army commander
is stripped for three years.

17:24.240 --> 17:25.010
Father.

17:25.720 --> 17:26.570
Father, this...

17:26.570 --> 17:28.130
♪Karma never falls empty♪

17:29.920 --> 17:31.490
Senior...

17:31.960 --> 17:34.290
Where are you now?

17:36.920 --> 17:37.810
Senior.

17:39.750 --> 17:41.700
What's wrong with your senior?

17:42.550 --> 17:46.290
He was killed by the Crown Prince.

17:54.480 --> 17:55.250
Senior.

17:55.640 --> 17:56.250
Senior.

17:56.270 --> 17:56.700
You're...

17:58.550 --> 17:59.330
Shh.

18:02.550 --> 18:03.860
Senior, what are you...

18:16.000 --> 18:16.490
This...

18:22.480 --> 18:23.700
Oh, it's you.

18:28.110 --> 18:29.900
But this time,

18:29.920 --> 18:31.250
wasn't it a little too dangerous?

18:31.270 --> 18:32.330
What if the Second Prince

18:32.350 --> 18:33.770
failed to open the Water Dragon Spout?

18:33.830 --> 18:34.700
Then we'd...

18:34.720 --> 18:36.570
You don't even trust me?

18:36.680 --> 18:37.620
Honestly.

18:37.640 --> 18:38.900
Of course, I trust you.

18:41.720 --> 18:43.490
Ao Yi is just Plan A.

18:43.510 --> 18:44.770
Even if he failed,

18:45.070 --> 18:46.010
I still had

18:46.640 --> 18:49.660
Plan B, Plan C, and Plan D.

18:51.830 --> 18:54.290
Senior, you surely played it safe.

18:59.310 --> 19:00.490
Ling'e.

19:01.310 --> 19:02.460
Changshou!

19:02.680 --> 19:03.380
Senior Changshou!

19:03.400 --> 19:03.980
Changshou.

19:04.000 --> 19:04.900
Senior, are you alright?

19:05.270 --> 19:05.700
Senior.

19:05.720 --> 19:06.700
Sorry, sorry.

19:06.720 --> 19:07.050
Senior.

19:07.070 --> 19:07.620
Glad you're back.

19:07.640 --> 19:08.290
Just having you back is enough.

19:12.480 --> 19:13.900
He needs to rest.

19:14.200 --> 19:14.980
So,

19:29.590 --> 19:30.570
please don't come by unless it's urgent.

19:31.960 --> 19:32.460
Turtle,

19:33.510 --> 19:35.290
regarding what Yi did today,

19:35.310 --> 19:36.090
what do you think?

19:37.830 --> 19:39.220
Utterly preposterous.

19:40.310 --> 19:41.460
Acting purely on a whim.

19:43.920 --> 19:46.090
What he did really surprised me.

19:46.110 --> 19:46.660
Good.

19:47.720 --> 19:49.220
Indeed, indeed. He did well.

19:49.240 --> 19:49.900
Yeah.

19:50.030 --> 19:52.530
I also believe that, given time,
the Second Prince

19:52.550 --> 19:55.220
will surely ease the burdens
of you and the First Prince.

19:56.350 --> 19:57.140
Enough.

19:57.310 --> 19:58.980
Don't waste time guessing my will.

19:59.720 --> 20:01.090
Just speak plainly.

20:01.550 --> 20:04.290
Jia has been rash lately.

20:06.070 --> 20:08.810
Have we crossed someone we shouldn't?

20:09.310 --> 20:13.090
I only know
that there have been minor clashes

20:13.110 --> 20:14.980
between the Human and Dragon Clans,

20:15.310 --> 20:17.660
and it was all led by the Crown Prince.

20:17.680 --> 20:19.010
It has nothing to do with you.

20:19.240 --> 20:22.460
You are our only Empyreal Vajra.

20:22.640 --> 20:26.050
No, the only Empyreal Aureate Immortal,

20:26.110 --> 20:27.090
keeping to the shadows,

20:27.110 --> 20:28.460
and never taking a side.

20:43.640 --> 20:44.700
You old turtle,

20:44.750 --> 20:47.700
your flattery keeps getting better.

20:48.680 --> 20:49.460
Well said.

20:51.310 --> 20:52.290
Whew, that was close.

21:16.680 --> 21:17.770
A stray note

21:19.270 --> 21:21.050
broke my whole tune.

21:38.310 --> 21:41.090
I just took a nap,

21:41.830 --> 21:43.090
and you actually

21:43.960 --> 21:46.900
botched such a big plan.

21:47.510 --> 21:50.660
I truly admire you.

21:57.750 --> 21:59.420
My identity has not been revealed.

22:00.480 --> 22:01.420
Yunxiao

22:02.070 --> 22:04.090
is still one of our pieces.

22:05.550 --> 22:06.900
How am I exposed?

22:07.440 --> 22:09.050
How was it botched?

22:12.920 --> 22:13.770
This step

22:14.440 --> 22:17.010
is the only way forward.

22:18.550 --> 22:19.620
What do you think,

22:21.030 --> 22:21.900
cultivator?

22:22.960 --> 22:24.620
The South Sea is my territory.

22:25.440 --> 22:28.420
Be it Fairy Yunxiao or Changgeng,

22:28.720 --> 22:29.770
once they come,

22:30.240 --> 22:32.220
they will all be my playthings.

22:35.350 --> 22:36.900
What arrogance.

22:39.550 --> 22:41.050
Is that really arrogance?

22:41.550 --> 22:42.660
In a few days,

22:43.480 --> 22:44.460
all will be clear.

22:49.110 --> 22:50.570
What scheme have you set now?

22:50.960 --> 22:51.730
Shh.

22:53.790 --> 22:54.570
Listen.

22:58.960 --> 22:59.900
Listen to what?

23:09.030 --> 23:11.980
A new hero is born.

23:13.310 --> 23:14.570
Changgeng

23:15.790 --> 23:17.730
should be even more fun

23:18.270 --> 23:19.490
than Yunxiao.

23:45.750 --> 23:46.530
Aunt.

23:48.590 --> 23:51.220
Senior Changshou nearly lost his life.

23:51.440 --> 23:53.220
He must have gained new insight.

23:54.400 --> 23:56.090
Better not disturb him.

23:59.240 --> 24:00.010
Let's go.

24:10.550 --> 24:11.380
In that case,

24:11.400 --> 24:13.490
Fairy Yunxiao's plot

24:13.510 --> 24:15.330
for the Sea-Calming Pillar is clear.

24:15.350 --> 24:16.330
I also found

24:16.350 --> 24:18.290
someone else behind Fairy Yunxiao.

24:18.310 --> 24:20.140
The motive is unclear,
and the identity is suspicious.

24:20.240 --> 24:21.810
You should pay attention to that.

24:28.310 --> 24:29.620
If you have questions,

24:29.920 --> 24:30.900
feel free to ask.

24:32.480 --> 24:34.330
Li Changshou,

24:34.960 --> 24:37.180
you met Fairy Yunxiao that day.

24:37.310 --> 24:40.220
Did you see a sword on her?

24:41.640 --> 24:42.730
A sword?

24:44.310 --> 24:46.460
Fairy Yunxiao has the Primordial Vessel

24:46.590 --> 24:47.530
and countless magic instruments.

24:47.550 --> 24:48.980
Which sword are you referring to?

24:50.880 --> 24:52.050
Indeed.

24:53.310 --> 24:55.810
Since Fairy Yunxiao
didn't steal the Pillar,

24:55.830 --> 24:56.770
it means

24:57.350 --> 24:59.050
the sword is not with her.

25:00.160 --> 25:01.700
What a relief!

25:02.000 --> 25:03.980
If the Pillar were taken,

25:04.030 --> 25:06.220
it'd be a world-shattering calamity.

25:06.350 --> 25:08.460
Exactly, exactly.

25:08.680 --> 25:10.460
In just a few days,

25:10.480 --> 25:13.940
this young man brought you
such vital info.

25:13.960 --> 25:16.090
Also, he protected the East Sea

25:16.160 --> 25:17.900
and prevented the Pillar's theft.

25:18.240 --> 25:19.330
What talent.

25:19.640 --> 25:22.010
Why not bring him
into the Celestial Court?

25:22.270 --> 25:24.010
Let him serve in my division.

25:24.030 --> 25:24.980
I'll take him.

25:25.790 --> 25:26.860
You're quite eager.

25:27.680 --> 25:29.290
What does that have to do with you?

25:31.830 --> 25:32.620
Li Changshou.

25:32.750 --> 25:33.090
Yes?

25:34.030 --> 25:36.420
You really want to serve
the Celestial Court?

25:36.440 --> 25:37.570
Yeah.

25:37.590 --> 25:38.330
How dare you?

25:41.240 --> 25:42.900
And you want to serve
the Celestial Court?

25:43.000 --> 25:45.330
You just said you stopped Fairy Yunxiao.

25:45.350 --> 25:46.620
Why not bring her here

25:46.640 --> 25:48.220
for judgment?

25:48.550 --> 25:48.900
Well.

25:50.400 --> 25:51.980
How could I manage that?

25:54.830 --> 25:55.620
True.

25:55.880 --> 25:57.490
Of course, you couldn't.

25:57.510 --> 25:58.940
But then again,

25:58.960 --> 26:00.940
you could at least report to me.

26:00.960 --> 26:01.700
Let me ask you.

26:01.720 --> 26:03.700
Where is Fairy Yunxiao?
Where did she go?

26:03.720 --> 26:06.220
Where are the stolen treasures?
How to restore them?

26:06.310 --> 26:09.140
How to punish her?
You can at least answer those questions.

26:09.160 --> 26:11.010
I have to handle that?

26:11.240 --> 26:13.250
Isn't it Celestial Court business?

26:16.750 --> 26:18.660
How dare you!

26:18.830 --> 26:19.420
Eastwood Duke.

26:19.590 --> 26:21.810
You dare shirk responsibility?

26:21.830 --> 26:22.220
No, not at all.

26:22.240 --> 26:23.460
The Celestial Court's duties.

26:23.550 --> 26:24.900
Do you know its duties?

26:25.070 --> 26:26.810
Listen, here are the rules:

26:26.830 --> 26:28.290
Credit goes to high immortals.

26:28.310 --> 26:29.530
Blame falls on minor officials.

26:29.550 --> 26:30.090
Minor officials.

26:30.110 --> 26:31.250
Here are the rules:

26:31.270 --> 26:33.530
If done well,
it's due to wise leadership.

26:33.550 --> 26:36.290
If done poorly, you're incompetent.

26:36.310 --> 26:37.050
Exactly.

26:37.070 --> 26:39.490
The Celestial Court had a grand plan.

26:39.510 --> 26:41.570
After extensive inquiries,

26:41.920 --> 26:43.290
we learned that Fairy Yunxiao

26:43.310 --> 26:45.010
would seize the Sea-Calming Pillar,

26:45.030 --> 26:47.380
so we cast a perfect net,

26:47.400 --> 26:49.330
waiting for that demoness to appear.

26:49.350 --> 26:50.220
And now, look.

26:50.720 --> 26:51.530
She's vanished!

26:52.350 --> 26:53.530
And it's all your fault!

26:53.720 --> 26:57.090
You ruined our scheme!

26:58.070 --> 26:58.490
This...

26:58.550 --> 26:59.090
Me?

26:59.200 --> 26:59.980
Enough!

27:00.200 --> 27:01.250
If you want to atone,

27:01.270 --> 27:04.010
bring Fairy Yunxiao
to the Celestial Court!

27:05.030 --> 27:05.810
Yes. No...

27:05.880 --> 27:06.330
I...

27:06.350 --> 27:07.940
Stop with that mumbling!

27:07.960 --> 27:09.660
Go now!

27:10.790 --> 27:12.010
Changshou!

27:23.640 --> 27:26.220
The Celestial Court feels familiar.

27:37.790 --> 27:38.730
Tian.

27:39.110 --> 27:39.900
At your service.

27:41.110 --> 27:41.860
Answer me:

27:41.880 --> 27:43.620
How long until the Great Tribulation?

27:44.400 --> 27:47.090
Thirty years remain.

27:48.680 --> 27:49.570
Thirty years?

27:49.590 --> 27:51.220
Last time, it was fifty.

27:52.000 --> 27:54.090
Please look at it from a broader view.

28:00.960 --> 28:02.090
As Eastwood Duke said,

28:02.880 --> 28:04.290
if the Sea-Calming Pillar is stolen,

28:04.310 --> 28:05.770
it will bring disaster to all.

28:05.790 --> 28:09.660
Could this be the Great Tribulation
Fate spoke of?

28:13.160 --> 28:13.980
Did things happen sooner

28:14.000 --> 28:15.730
because I let Fairy Yunxiao go?

28:17.310 --> 28:18.090
No, no!

28:19.790 --> 28:20.570
No.

28:21.030 --> 28:22.220
I must bring her back

28:22.240 --> 28:22.980
and make up for it.

28:23.000 --> 28:24.420
I must reach Celestial Court soon.

28:24.830 --> 28:25.620
Senior.

28:26.400 --> 28:27.180
Senior.

28:28.920 --> 28:30.250
Senior, you're awake.

28:33.200 --> 28:33.980
Come here. Stop!

28:35.240 --> 28:36.010
Junior.

28:36.550 --> 28:37.330
Cover me.

28:42.030 --> 28:44.460
Why is it always me?

28:45.400 --> 28:46.140
Where's Changshou?

28:46.160 --> 28:46.730
Where is he?

28:47.240 --> 28:48.050
Where's Senior Changshou?

28:48.110 --> 28:48.620
He...

28:49.640 --> 28:50.730
He went to sweep his parents' graves.

28:50.750 --> 28:51.490
Sweeping graves?

28:52.270 --> 28:53.050
Sweeping graves...

28:53.070 --> 28:54.770
He's indeed loyal and filial.

28:54.920 --> 28:56.980
He cultivates yet remembers his roots.

28:57.240 --> 28:57.660
That's right.

28:57.680 --> 28:58.290
Wait a moment.

28:58.310 --> 28:59.090
His parents?

29:01.310 --> 29:03.490
His family is long deceased.

29:04.000 --> 29:05.380
He's quite resilient.

29:05.880 --> 29:06.380
This...

29:06.750 --> 29:07.770
Near the sea?

29:08.400 --> 29:09.380
Is he a fisherman?

29:10.030 --> 29:12.050
Surely not a merman, right?

29:14.240 --> 29:15.330
His family

29:15.920 --> 29:17.770
must have endured so much hardship.

29:19.200 --> 29:20.010
Senior,

29:20.590 --> 29:23.010
may you find peace and return safely.

29:27.590 --> 29:30.140
This is absolutely unbearable!

29:36.680 --> 29:38.090
The Second Prince

29:38.110 --> 29:39.620
is still sleeping at high noon.

29:39.880 --> 29:41.220
How enviable, indeed.

29:42.400 --> 29:44.530
He didn't get a wink
of sleep last night,

29:44.550 --> 29:45.660
rambling on till the wee hours.

29:46.920 --> 29:47.900
What was he saying?

29:48.200 --> 29:51.570
He talked of venturing
to the human world

29:51.750 --> 29:53.180
and studying from the Human Clan.

29:53.200 --> 29:54.330
The Second Prince

29:54.350 --> 29:55.810
hardly ever leaves the Dragon Palace.

29:55.880 --> 29:57.660
And he met so many friends all at once.

29:57.920 --> 29:59.980
He might just be overexcited.

30:00.070 --> 30:00.770
Indeed.

30:00.790 --> 30:02.900
He even kept me up,

30:02.920 --> 30:05.330
claiming that humans
are the wisest of all,

30:05.510 --> 30:06.900
and for the Dragon Clan to rise,

30:06.920 --> 30:09.810
we must learn from the human strength.

30:09.830 --> 30:10.940
So, what did you say?

30:11.160 --> 30:13.420
I said, "You're still young."

30:13.440 --> 30:15.420
"His Majesty would never let you out."

30:15.720 --> 30:17.900
At that, Second Prince got angry,

30:17.920 --> 30:19.980
hid under the quilt,
and wouldn't speak to me.

30:23.920 --> 30:24.700
Your Highness.

30:26.200 --> 30:27.050
Your Highness.

30:28.200 --> 30:30.900
Is sleeping late
a human strength too?

30:33.030 --> 30:34.250
Your Highness.

30:34.350 --> 30:36.290
Don't sleep with your head
covered like that.

30:36.640 --> 30:37.980
Your Highness!

30:38.440 --> 30:39.490
Where is he?

30:40.920 --> 30:43.810
Did he truly go to train
in the human world?

31:01.350 --> 31:02.380
Forgive me, Father.

31:02.480 --> 31:04.490
For our clan's future, I must leave.

31:05.680 --> 31:07.380
After I finish my studies,

31:07.680 --> 31:08.940
I'll become a ray of light

31:09.350 --> 31:10.380
to lead our clan

31:11.880 --> 31:13.010
back to glory.

31:23.590 --> 31:24.380
What is happening?

31:39.070 --> 31:39.860
I failed?

31:40.200 --> 31:41.380
You can do it, Ao Yi.

31:41.400 --> 31:42.420
You can do it.

31:43.790 --> 31:44.770
I can do it.

32:28.680 --> 32:31.140
As I recall,

32:31.750 --> 32:33.570
you were at just this age

32:33.590 --> 32:35.050
when you set sail to train.

32:35.200 --> 32:37.420
Then, you made
the empire you have today.

32:38.640 --> 32:39.900
This déjà vu

32:40.400 --> 32:43.570
really moved me.

32:43.590 --> 32:44.460
Turtle,

32:45.750 --> 32:47.010
what are you saying?

32:47.310 --> 32:49.220
I don't understand a word of this.

32:50.440 --> 32:51.570
Well, yes.

32:52.110 --> 32:53.770
I said nothing.

32:53.790 --> 32:54.860
I saw nothing.

33:00.590 --> 33:01.380
Don't cry.

33:01.400 --> 33:02.490
Don't cry, don't cry.

33:03.000 --> 33:04.010
There, there.

33:04.030 --> 33:05.420
Yi will come back.

33:05.440 --> 33:06.700
He'll be back very soon.

33:30.400 --> 33:31.460
So, this is the human world?

33:42.400 --> 33:43.420
The scent of my benefactor.

34:00.310 --> 34:02.290
Fairy Yunxiao's Resonance lingers here

34:02.310 --> 34:03.570
and then stops abruptly.

34:03.830 --> 34:05.660
Not a single trace.

34:06.160 --> 34:07.180
Where did she go?

34:15.800 --> 34:17.260
I see.

34:18.920 --> 34:20.010
But that's so far.

34:21.000 --> 34:22.900
No means of transport at all?

34:30.300 --> 34:33.180
[Bear Island, South Sea]

34:48.220 --> 34:51.340
[Xiong Da]

35:02.190 --> 35:03.010
I've lost weight.

35:07.960 --> 35:09.650
[Xiong Er]
This is hardly enough to eat.

35:10.190 --> 35:12.090
Yeah, look how thin they all are.

35:12.510 --> 35:14.050
Including me, my arm...

35:14.190 --> 35:15.900
Even my belly has gotten smaller.

35:15.920 --> 35:17.050
You've worked hard, Da.

35:19.510 --> 35:20.340
Where's our little sister?

35:20.480 --> 35:21.260
Xiong Lingli.

35:21.760 --> 35:23.170
Xiong Lingli!

35:23.190 --> 35:23.860
Here.

35:24.360 --> 35:25.860
[Xiong Lingli]
Come give me a hand.

35:27.590 --> 35:28.170
So big!

35:30.230 --> 35:31.210
Such a big fish!

35:31.400 --> 35:32.740
This must weigh over a thousand jin!

35:33.320 --> 35:34.130
We'll have meat to eat, Da.

35:34.150 --> 35:34.570
We'll have meat to eat.

35:34.590 --> 35:35.900
This is enough for two or three meals.

35:37.000 --> 35:38.530
Lingli, you need to eat more.

35:38.550 --> 35:39.900
You're still growing.

35:39.920 --> 35:40.690
Sure.

35:59.190 --> 36:01.380
Ah, Li Changshou.

36:02.150 --> 36:03.940
Tell me.

36:04.360 --> 36:06.570
Where does your heart truly belong?

36:08.550 --> 36:09.960
[Jiu Jiu]
Not her.

36:09.960 --> 36:11.380
[Youqin Xuanya]
Not her.

36:11.400 --> 36:13.300
[Lan Ling'e]
Not her.

36:13.590 --> 36:15.900
Then who could it be?

36:17.070 --> 36:19.210
This is baffling me.

36:22.800 --> 36:23.940
Moon Elder.

36:25.670 --> 36:26.130
Who?

36:27.880 --> 36:28.820
Is that you, Changshou?

36:28.940 --> 36:29.800
[Li Changshou]

36:29.800 --> 36:30.860
Changshou?

36:31.800 --> 36:32.380
Changshou...

36:40.190 --> 36:41.610
I found her at last.

36:42.030 --> 36:43.260
Finally.

36:43.280 --> 36:44.090
I've got to see

36:44.110 --> 36:46.530
who your true love really is.

36:54.630 --> 36:55.570
Fairy Yunxiao?

36:55.570 --> 36:56.700
[Yunxiao]

37:04.400 --> 37:05.780
Everything went smoothly.

37:09.630 --> 37:10.460
Mostly.

37:26.480 --> 37:27.820
Go scout.

37:38.000 --> 37:38.780
Something's wrong.

37:40.670 --> 37:41.690
Empyreal Vase.

37:42.360 --> 37:43.530
Big Dipper Sword.

37:44.190 --> 37:45.420
Ghostvein Powder.

37:46.150 --> 37:47.380
Thunderheart Art.

37:50.670 --> 37:52.780
Why did all my trump cards fail?

37:55.760 --> 37:57.130
Where's my magical power?

37:58.030 --> 37:58.820
Guess.

38:06.510 --> 38:07.900
You rascal.

38:08.110 --> 38:09.820
You truly followed my Resonance here.

38:11.710 --> 38:12.780
It was you

38:13.630 --> 38:14.980
who lured me here.

38:15.190 --> 38:17.090
I thought you'd arrive sooner.

38:17.400 --> 38:19.490
It seems I overestimated
your cultivation.

38:22.360 --> 38:24.900
So, you took my power?

38:25.190 --> 38:26.090
What do you think?

38:27.280 --> 38:28.420
Who are you really?

38:28.800 --> 38:29.530
Who told you

38:29.550 --> 38:30.530
to seize the Skyscraping Vine

38:30.550 --> 38:32.050
and storm the Crystal Palace?

38:32.480 --> 38:33.490
And for what reason?

38:33.510 --> 38:35.780
I've never pried, Yunxiao.

38:36.360 --> 38:37.340
And please,

38:37.550 --> 38:39.300
don't press me for answers.

38:40.400 --> 38:43.010
I've read many esoteric books,

38:43.030 --> 38:44.570
yet I've never heard

38:44.590 --> 38:45.940
of any spell

38:46.030 --> 38:48.980
that can seize
one's magical power so entirely.

38:49.550 --> 38:51.610
How did you manage
that?

38:51.670 --> 38:53.170
Answer my question first.

38:57.110 --> 38:57.980
Watch out, Yunxiao!

39:07.840 --> 39:08.610
I thought...

39:09.550 --> 39:10.420
I thought

39:10.920 --> 39:13.490
only I was trapped here.

39:14.000 --> 39:15.130
You've got sharp eyes.

39:15.400 --> 39:16.940
So, you didn't leave

39:16.960 --> 39:18.780
the Resonance on the sea

39:18.800 --> 39:19.900
to lure me here.

39:19.920 --> 39:21.690
You're also trapped.

39:21.800 --> 39:23.170
That's why you can't retrieve it.

39:24.110 --> 39:24.980
So, is this also why

39:25.000 --> 39:26.490
your Resonance

39:26.710 --> 39:27.780
suddenly cut off outside the island?

39:28.000 --> 39:29.380
The spiritual energy here is thin.

39:29.920 --> 39:31.530
The residents are all mortals.

39:31.590 --> 39:32.780
They have no magic power.

39:33.670 --> 39:35.570
But the one who set the trap here

39:35.840 --> 39:37.420
could seal my power.

39:38.400 --> 39:39.860
I originally thought it was you.

39:40.150 --> 39:41.740
Now, it seems I was overthinking.

39:42.480 --> 39:44.170
Containing my power

39:44.400 --> 39:45.820
isn't hard.

39:47.110 --> 39:50.090
But containing your Quasi-Saint power...

39:50.110 --> 39:51.490
I am an innate being

39:51.550 --> 39:53.530
beyond the Three Realms
and the Five Elements.

39:54.070 --> 39:55.610
But my power was also sealed.

39:55.630 --> 39:58.610
That only means that the curse here

39:59.000 --> 40:00.300
is even older than me.

40:02.480 --> 40:03.170
Yunxiao,

40:03.710 --> 40:05.780
someone set a trap here deliberately.

40:05.800 --> 40:07.380
You and I are trapped here.

40:07.400 --> 40:07.820
No.

40:08.630 --> 40:10.170
Only you are trapped here.

40:16.030 --> 40:16.780
When...?

40:16.800 --> 40:18.260
I got here a day before you

40:18.280 --> 40:20.570
and spent all night
filing off these shackles.

40:21.070 --> 40:23.490
You can work on that here tonight.

40:28.400 --> 40:31.380
Now, nobody's trapped here.

40:31.840 --> 40:32.530
How did you...?

40:32.550 --> 40:33.570
I have my way.

40:34.480 --> 40:35.650
Unorthodox way.

40:35.710 --> 40:38.210
Are you here for the sword?

40:43.840 --> 40:45.570
You also know of the Pregenesis Sword?

40:49.030 --> 40:51.460
Of course, I know

40:53.150 --> 40:54.460
of that Pregenesis Sword.

40:58.070 --> 40:59.380
Did the Dragon King tell you?

41:00.760 --> 41:02.380
I didn't expect the Dragon King

41:02.960 --> 41:04.780
to tell you too.

41:05.000 --> 41:07.570
Only he knows that the Pregenesis Sword

41:07.630 --> 41:08.820
undoes the Sea-Calming Pillar's seal.

41:08.920 --> 41:11.010
That sword undoes the seal?

41:13.280 --> 41:14.490
How dare you fish for info from me?

41:14.670 --> 41:15.380
No, no.

41:15.400 --> 41:16.170
I wasn't fishing for info.

41:16.190 --> 41:17.130
I just love listening to you talk.

41:17.150 --> 41:18.340
I'm listening, I'm listening.

41:19.440 --> 41:20.570
You think I can't handle you

41:20.590 --> 41:21.690
without magical power?

41:21.840 --> 41:23.050
Of course, you can.

41:23.070 --> 41:25.420
I know what your deepest fear is.

41:26.000 --> 41:26.740
It's me.

41:28.550 --> 41:31.050
Your eyes show fear.

41:31.190 --> 41:33.780
You fear me, yet you seek me out.

41:33.800 --> 41:34.980
I know you.

41:35.190 --> 41:36.940
You'd never do this.

41:37.230 --> 41:38.980
You'd never invite
such karmic entanglement.

41:39.110 --> 41:40.940
What exactly are you plotting?

41:40.960 --> 41:42.780
The one who sent you
isn't the Dragon King.

41:42.800 --> 41:43.820
It's the Celestial Court.

41:45.510 --> 41:47.050
You're from the Celestial Court.

41:49.920 --> 41:51.650
Yunxiao, someone's coming.

41:52.070 --> 41:53.210
I'm still useful alive.

41:53.230 --> 41:54.940
Why not untie me first?

41:55.400 --> 41:56.460
You'd better be useful.

42:03.630 --> 42:04.780
I'm very useful.

42:04.800 --> 42:05.650
They treated us like prey,

42:05.670 --> 42:06.980
locking us in here.

42:07.000 --> 42:08.490
I have many ways to kill them.

42:11.800 --> 42:12.980
If anyone tries to enter,

42:13.000 --> 42:14.380
the door bolt will stop them.

42:14.400 --> 42:15.380
If it were you,

42:15.800 --> 42:16.740
what would you do?

42:17.510 --> 42:18.530
Ignore the lock,

42:18.550 --> 42:19.690
and push the door open.

42:19.710 --> 42:21.380
If he forces the door open,

42:21.400 --> 42:22.340
the water in the bucket

42:22.360 --> 42:23.530
will come pouring down,

42:23.550 --> 42:24.860
blocking his line of sight.

42:25.000 --> 42:27.170
At the same time, the axe will fall,

42:27.190 --> 42:29.490
leaving him dead or half-crippled.

42:29.630 --> 42:30.650
And that moment

42:31.280 --> 42:33.210
will be our chance.

42:33.230 --> 42:34.780
But what if he turns back first

42:35.190 --> 42:36.530
and peers through a window?

42:37.000 --> 42:37.780
What a coincidence.

42:38.280 --> 42:40.530
I've already spread poison powder

42:40.630 --> 42:41.780
at every window and vent,

42:41.880 --> 42:43.690
waiting for his grand arrival.

42:44.140 --> 42:46.450
♪Let the comings and goings be♪

42:46.450 --> 42:48.350
♪Let the answer be empty♪

42:48.400 --> 42:50.740
I never thought you could set

42:51.030 --> 42:53.090
such a thorough trap
without magic spells.

42:53.110 --> 42:55.260
If you can ambush, why assault head-on?

42:55.670 --> 42:58.130
If poison works, why use spells?

43:01.030 --> 43:02.820
What's with that look?

43:03.000 --> 43:04.820
Unfortunately, all these tricks

43:05.030 --> 43:06.780
may not work on the locals here.

43:06.800 --> 43:09.380
You said they don't know magic spells.

43:09.400 --> 43:10.820
More than that.

43:11.110 --> 43:11.740
They...

43:14.030 --> 43:14.860
Forget it.

43:15.320 --> 43:16.490
You'll see when you meet them.

43:22.670 --> 43:23.380
They're here.

44:03.780 --> 44:09.560
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

44:10.230 --> 44:16.930
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

44:18.460 --> 44:24.510
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

44:25.140 --> 44:31.590
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

44:32.330 --> 44:39.450
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

44:39.830 --> 44:46.730
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

44:47.110 --> 44:54.460
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

44:54.460 --> 45:01.630
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

45:17.770 --> 45:22.940
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

45:24.030 --> 45:31.050
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

45:32.240 --> 45:38.180
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

45:38.880 --> 45:45.960
♪Alas, our story is short♪

45:46.300 --> 45:53.410
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

45:53.730 --> 46:00.210
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

46:00.990 --> 46:08.200
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

46:08.590 --> 46:16.410
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
